WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back, arms up, knees over hips.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press low back gently toward the mat.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Extend opposite arm and leg without arching.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Return and switch sides.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Move slow and steady.
